  "data": {
    "ruleType": "army-rule",
    "summary": "Each friendly ANATHEMA PSYKANA unit that has this ability gets Feel No Pain 3+ versus psychic attacks, and also has the Psychic Null (Aura) ability: any friendly ADEPTUS CUSTODES unit that is within 6\" of it gets Feel No Pain 5+ versus psychic attacks. Your army can contain ANATHEMA PSYKANA units although ADEPTUS CUSTODES is not one of their faction keywords. Unless a rule says otherwise, though, ANATHEMA PSYKANA can't be chosen as your army faction, and no ANATHEMA PSYKANA model can be made your WARLORD.",
